# Program 19: Book Inventory

## Aim
To create a simple book inventory system using C++.

## Description
The program stores book details such as book ID, name, and quantity.

## Concept Used
- Classes and objects
- Constructor
- Vector
- Functions
- Menu-driven program

## How It Works
The user can add books to the inventory and view the stored book details.

## Output
The program displays the book ID, book name, and quantity.

## Conclusion
A simple book inventory system was successfully implemented using C++.
